# The Wayward Automaton (ahtUrhgan 27), the quest's own var at the completion: a PUP of level 40 with
# No Strings Attached completed, the Animator, this quest accepted, TheWaywardAutomatonProgress 3 and Quest[6][27]Prog 1
# (GMs). Iruki-Waraki (the second talk of a pair: No Strings Attached's 267 first): 776; finished: npcUtil.completeQuest
# (the Turbo Animator, the progress var 0, completed). npcUtil.completeQuest does no cleanup: Quest[6][27]Prog stays 1
# (quest:complete's cleanup would clear it).
char zone=AhtUrhganWhitegate pos=102.8,-6.0,-29.0 job=PUP lvl=40
quest AhtUrhgan.NoStringsAttached completed
item Animator
quest AhtUrhgan.TheWaywardAutomaton accepted
charvar TheWaywardAutomatonProgress 3
charvar Quest[6][27]Prog 1              # a GM: the quest's own var
login
trigger Iruki-Waraki                    # No Strings Attached's 267
finish
trigger Iruki-Waraki                    # accepted, progress 3: 776
finish                                  # the Turbo Animator; the progress var 0; completed, Prog kept
